  "id": "proposed-service-review",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Proposed service review",
    "description": "A participant submits a request through an explicit boundary. A scoped grant controls a check before state/history is written. This diagram describes a proposal; it does not execute authority or external effects. Slots: C5 requests/actions; C6 authority/control; C4 observations/evidence; C1 reserved for refusal/protection; M1 hosts. Inspect an unused standard port before removing it."
